# Play check 4 (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5): the first campaign mission, whose triggers play their WAVs. A box
# over the five Marines at the start (as determinism.kps boxes them), a right click away from them (the camera placed
# in the frame of each, as a trigger may move it), the game's steps until 600; then play_tail.kps's checks.
# tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission terran/terran01
video originals

wait game
wait frames 3
mark start
log start tick creep.tiles units:0 units:1 units:2 units:3 units:4 units:5 units:6 units:7
camera 400 150 &
press world 160 80 &
release world 222 172
log box selected
expect selected == 5
wait tick >= 2
camera 400 150 &
rclick world 700 200
wait tick >= 600
include play_tail.kps
